{"title": "Predator Essence (Condition)", "pageid": 28238, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Predator_Essence_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Buff Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Predator Essence</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Each Predator Essence heals the Houndmaster for <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">4d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. Moreover, he deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">4d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">necrotic</span></a> when he casts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grave_Shot\" title=\"Grave Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grave Shot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grave_Shot\" title=\"Grave Shot\">Grave Shot</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_HOUNDMASTER_PREDATORESSENCE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_HOUNDMASTER_PREDATORESSENCE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_HOUNDMASTER_PREDATORESSENCE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 1</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grave_Shot\" title=\"Grave Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png/60px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png/80px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grave Shot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grave_Shot\" title=\"Grave Shot\">Grave Shot</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Loose a bolt of necrotic energy. You can spend <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Predator_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Predator Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Predator Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Predator Essence</a> to empower the shot. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition is generated only through the following chain of events: <a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster_Pol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Houndmaster Pol\">Houndmaster Pol</a> casts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster%27s_Mark\" title=\"Houndmaster's Mark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/38px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/50px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Houndmaster's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster%27s_Mark\" title=\"Houndmaster's Mark\">Houndmaster's Mark</a>, one of his dogs (<a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>) hits the marked target to gather <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prey Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\">Prey Essence</a>, then the same dog uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Have_Nice_Gift!\" title=\"Have Nice Gift!\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/38px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/50px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Have Nice Gift!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Have_Nice_Gift!\" title=\"Have Nice Gift!\">Have Nice Gift!</a> to transfer the essence and develop one Predator stack.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Predator_Essence\">Sources of Predator Essence</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Have_Nice_Gift!\" title=\"Have Nice Gift!\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/30px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/45px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/60px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Have Nice Gift!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp/30px-Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Help_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Have_Nice_Gift!\" title=\"Have Nice Gift!\">Have Nice Gift!</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715025723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3057/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36308/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13399/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.032/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1156120/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion t